{"id":"vod_md_5585","vodId":"5585","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"摇曳百合3","name_cn":"摇曳百合3","date":"2015-01-01","year":"2015","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"12集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20231005-1/94206a496f95539af9c03cc9ab365166.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在七森中学中，茶道社因为人气不佳最终面临闭社的悲惨命运，单纯天真懵懂无知的赤座灯里（三上枝织 配音）、开朗热情的暴走少女岁纳京子（大坪由佳 配音）、沉默寡言但却是吐槽担当的船见结衣（津田美波 配音）和看似可爱人畜无害实则十分腹黑的吉川千夏（大久保瑠美 配音）四名女生占据了茶道社的活动教室，在这里另起炉灶成立了娱乐部。故事的序幕就此拉开。娱乐部的存在竟然引起了学生会的注意，身世神秘的会长松本理世（后藤沙绪里 配音）和傲娇不坦率的副会长杉浦绫乃（藤田咲 配音）的介入让本来就热闹的社团生活增添了一份欢乐。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-10-05 08:10:10","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231002/CTVgW6pb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231002/JbniVVCJ/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231002/EMnExERR/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231002/edI9JrrR/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231002/gQRWVEOe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231002/YUA7zanO/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231002/TSgYq2CV/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231003/2CEyTJyP/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231003/u93UaB8q/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231003/B6Qy8nr5/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231003/zQNLHfTh/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231003/7BhyRHOg/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:35:41.345Z"}